@KMC_Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7172
@OrganizerToken = paste-organizer-jwt-here
@ParticipantToken = paste-participant-jwt-here
@EventId = 1
@RegistrationId = 1

### Health
GET {{KMC_Api_HostAddress}}/health

### Scalar UI
# Open in a browser: {{KMC_Api_HostAddress}}/scalar/v1

### Register Organizer
POST {{KMC_Api_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Kandy Event Organizer",
  "email": "organizer@kmc.lk",
  "password": "Organizer2026A",
  "role": "Organizer"
}

### Register Participant
POST {{KMC_Api_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Kandy Participant",
  "email": "participant@kmc.lk",
  "password": "Participant2026A",
  "role": "Participant"
}

### Login Organizer
POST {{KMC_Api_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "organizer@kmc.lk",
  "password": "Organizer2026A"
}

### Login Participant
POST {{KMC_Api_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "participant@kmc.lk",
  "password": "Participant2026A"
}

### Create Published Event
POST {{KMC_Api_HostAddress}}/api/Events
Authorization: Bearer {{OrganizerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Kandy Community Innovation Day",
  "description": "A city event connecting residents, students and local organizations.",
  "eventType": "Community",
  "eventDate": "2026-12-15",
  "startTime": "09:00:00",
  "endTime": "16:00:00",
  "venue": "Kandy Municipal Council Hall",
  "location": "Kandy",
  "capacity": 250,
  "status": "Published"
}

### Public Search
GET {{KMC_Api_HostAddress}}/api/Events?eventType=Community&location=Kandy
Accept: application/json

### Public Event Details
GET {{KMC_Api_HostAddress}}/api/Events/{{EventId}}
Accept: application/json

### Organizer Events
GET {{KMC_Api_HostAddress}}/api/Events/my-events
Authorization: Bearer {{OrganizerToken}}

### Participant Registers
POST {{KMC_Api_HostAddress}}/api/Registrations/events/{{EventId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ParticipantToken}}

### Participant Registrations
GET {{KMC_Api_HostAddress}}/api/Registrations/my-registrations
Authorization: Bearer {{ParticipantToken}}

### Organizer Views Participants
GET {{KMC_Api_HostAddress}}/api/Registrations/events/{{EventId}}/participants
Authorization: Bearer {{OrganizerToken}}

### Participant Cancels Registration
DELETE {{KMC_Api_HostAddress}}/api/Registrations/{{RegistrationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ParticipantToken}}

### Partner organizer synchronizes an event
POST {{KMC_Api_HostAddress}}/api/PartnerEvents/sync
X-Partner-Api-Key: organizer-demo-secret-key
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "externalEventCode": "ORG-DEMO-001",
  "sourceEventId": 1,
  "sourceSystem": "Organizer.Api",
  "title": "Kandy Heritage Music Evening",
  "description": "A partner event synchronized from an organizer website.",
  "eventType": "Cultural",
  "eventDate": "2026-11-15",
  "startTime": "17:00:00",
  "endTime": "21:00:00",
  "venue": "Kandy Heritage Centre",
  "location": "Kandy",
  "organizerName": "Sparkling Events Kandy",
  "organizerEventUrl": "https://localhost:7193/Events/Details?id=1",
  "isPublished": true
}

### Public partner events
GET {{KMC_Api_HostAddress}}/api/PartnerEvents
Accept: application/json
